flowchart TD
    A[Blocker hit] --> B{Type?}
    B -->|"I don't know"| C[KNOWLEDGE]
    B -->|"Need credential/decision"| D[AUTHORITY]
    B -->|"Policy forbids"| E[POLICY]

    C --> F[Ledger row 1: official docs<br/>fetch pinned version]
    F --> G{Answer?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Apply + verify]
    G -->|No| I[Ledger row 2: repo files<br/>read relevant code/tests]
    I --> J{Answer?}
    J -->|Yes| H
    J -->|No| K[Ledger row 3: changelog<br/>version boundary]
    K --> L{Answer?}
    L -->|Yes| H
    L -->|No| M[Ledger row 4: source code<br/>read module]
    M --> N{Answer?}
    N -->|Yes| H
    N -->|No| O[Ledger row 5: issues<br/>search exact error]
    O --> P{Answer?}
    P -->|Yes| H
    P -->|No| Q[Ledger row 6: web search<br/>fetch top maintained]
    Q --> R{Answer?}
    R -->|Yes| H
    R -->|No| S[Ledger row 7: community<br/>with version caveat]
    S --> T{Answer?}
    T -->|Yes| H
    T -->|No| U[Ledger COMPLETE]
    U --> V[STOP with ledger + question]

    D --> W[One comment, exact question<br/>+ ledger]
    E --> W
    W --> X[Stop]